tion\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"details\":\"\\u9322\\u5305\\u4f4d\\u5740\\u7684**\\u9328\\u9ede\\u5be6\\u4f5c**\\uff1a\\u5b83\\u5b58\\u5728\\u7684\\u552f\\u4e00\\u76ee\\u7684\\uff0c\\u662f\\u8b93 CREATE2 \\u4f4d\\u5740\\u63a8\\u5c0e \\u6c38\\u9060\\u4e0d\\u96a8\\u5e33\\u6236\\u5be6\\u4f5c\\u7248\\u672c\\u6539\\u8b8a\\u3002 ## \\u5b83\\u89e3\\u7684\\u554f\\u984c V1 factory \\u7684 `getAddress` \\u628a `accountImplementation` \\u7de8\\u9032 CREATE2 \\u7684 init-code hash\\u2014\\u2014\\u5be6\\u4f5c\\u4e00\\u63db\\uff0c**\\u540c\\u4e00\\u7d44 credential \\u63a8\\u5c0e\\u51fa\\u7684\\u4f4d\\u5740\\u5c31\\u8b8a\\u4e86**\\u3002 \\u9019\\u6b63\\u662f V1 factory \\u7121\\u6cd5\\u652f\\u63f4\\u5347\\u7d1a\\u7684\\u6839\\u56e0\\uff1a\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u7f3a\\u4e00\\u500b setter\\uff0c\\u800c\\u662f\\u4f4d\\u5740\\u63a8\\u5c0e \\u7d81\\u6b7b\\u4e86\\u5be6\\u4f5c\\u3002 ## \\u5b83\\u600e\\u9ebc\\u89e3 \\u6240\\u6709 proxy \\u4e00\\u5f8b\\u4ee5 anchor\\uff08\\u672c\\u5408\\u7d04\\uff0c\\u4f4d\\u5740\\u6c38\\u4e45\\u56fa\\u5b9a\\uff09\\u70ba\\u5efa\\u69cb\\u53c3\\u6578\\u90e8\\u7f72\\uff0c \\u56e0\\u6b64\\u63a8\\u5c0e\\u53ea\\u4f9d\\u8cf4 (factory, anchor, credential, salt)\\u3002`initialize` \\u5728 proxy \\u5efa\\u69cb\\u7684\\u540c\\u4e00\\u7b46\\u4ea4\\u6613\\u5167\\uff1a 1. \\u5beb\\u5165\\u4e09\\u628a\\u9470\\u5319\\uff08storage \\u4f48\\u5c40**\\u5fc5\\u9808**\\u8207 Fido2Account \\u5b8c\\u5168\\u4e00\\u81f4\\u2014\\u2014    slot0 credentialId / slot1 pubKeyX / slot2 pubKeyY\\uff1bInitializable    \\u662f ERC-7201 \\u547d\\u540d\\u7a7a\\u9593\\u5132\\u5b58\\uff0c\\u4e0d\\u4f54\\u5e8f\\u5217 slot\\uff09 2. \\u5411 factory\\uff08proxy \\u5efa\\u69cb\\u671f\\u9593\\u7684 `msg.sender`\\uff09\\u8b80\\u53d6**\\u7576\\u4e0b**\\u7684\\u6b63\\u5f0f\\u5be6\\u4f5c 3. \\u628a ERC-1967 implementation slot \\u81ea\\u6211\\u5347\\u7d1a\\u904e\\u53bb \\u5b8c\\u6210\\u5f8c\\u9019\\u500b proxy \\u5c31\\u662f\\u4e00\\u500b\\u666e\\u901a\\u7684 UUPS \\u5e33\\u6236\\uff0c\\u4e4b\\u5f8c\\u7684\\u5347\\u7d1a\\u7167\\u820a\\u7531\\u9322\\u5305\\u6301\\u6709\\u4eba \\u81ea\\u5df1\\u7c3d\\uff08`_authorizeUpgrade` \\u9650 EntryPoint\\uff09\\uff0canchor \\u4e0d\\u518d\\u53c3\\u8207\\u3002 ## \\u5b89\\u5168\\u6027 - `initializer` \\u5beb\\u5165\\u7684\\u662f\\u8207\\u6b63\\u5f0f\\u5be6\\u4f5c**\\u540c\\u4e00\\u500b** ERC-7201 slot\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u5347\\u7d1a\\u904e\\u53bb   \\u4e4b\\u5f8c `initialize` \\u4e0d\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u88ab\\u518d\\u547c\\u53eb\\u4e00\\u6b21\\uff08\\u52ab\\u6301\\u9470\\u5319\\u7684\\u8def\\u88ab\\u9396\\u6b7b\\uff09\\u3002 - anchor \\u672c\\u9ad4 `_disableInitializers()`\\uff1a\\u6c92\\u6709\\u4eba\\u80fd\\u521d\\u59cb\\u5316 anchor \\u81ea\\u5df1\\u3002 - \\u4efb\\u4f55\\u4eba\\u90fd\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u62ff anchor \\u53bb\\u90e8\\u7f72\\u81ea\\u5df1\\u7684 proxy \\u914d\\u81ea\\u5df1\\u7684\\u5047 factory\\u2014\\u2014\\u90a3\\u662f   \\u4ed6\\u81ea\\u5df1\\u7684 proxy\\uff0c\\u8207\\u672c\\u7cfb\\u7d71\\u7684\\u63a8\\u5c0e\\uff08\\u7d81\\u5b9a\\u6211\\u5011\\u7684 factory \\u4f4d\\u5740\\uff09\\u7121\\u95dc\\u3002\",\"errors\":{\"AddressEmptyCode(address)\":[{\"details\":\"There's no code at `target` (it is not a contract).\"}],\"ERC1967InvalidImplementation(address)\":[{\"details\":\"The `implementation` of the proxy is invalid.\"}],\"ERC1967NonPayable()\":[{\"details\":\"An upgrade function sees `msg.value > 0` that may be lost.\"}],\"FailedInnerCall()\":[{\"details\":\"A call to an address target failed. The target may have reverted.\"}],\"InvalidInitialization()\":[{\"details\":\"The contract is already initialized.\"}],\"NotInitializing()\":[{\"details\":\"The contract is not initializing.\"}]},\"events\":{\"Initialized(uint64)\":{\"details\":\"Triggered when the contract has been initialized or reinitialized.\"},\"Upgraded(address)\":{\"details\":\"Emitted when the implementation is upgraded.\"}},\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{},\"title\":\"Fido2AccountAnchor\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{},\"notice\":\"Info: (20260821 - Luphia)\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"contracts/fido2_account_anchor.sol\":\"Fido2AccountAnchor\"},\"evmVersion\":\"prague\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@erc3643org/=node_modules/@erc3643org/\",\":hardhat/=node_modules/hardhat/\"],\"viaIR\":true},\"sources\":{\"contracts/fido2_account_anchor.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x19c416f8630c2de2769d1a6f3848f317d9f6bb25106407e2df922efbe31891ac\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://41b954fb5f5fb5fb45b17f63fb766c61ab9b6909ee36974b57900260f0236059\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmYSp2WResLEE5zQfzDyYb2mzE2VaxNvHcLrEccQQoGmko\"]},\"contracts/lib/@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/ERC1967/ERC1967Utils.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x06a78f9b3ee3e6d0eb4e4cd635ba49960bea34cac1db8c0a27c75f2319f1fd65\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://547d21aa17f4f3f1a1a7edf7167beff8dd9496a0348d5588f15cc8a4b29d052a\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmT16JtRQSWNpLo9W23jr6CzaMuTAcQcjJJcdRd8HLJ6cE\"]},\"contracts/lib/@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/beacon/IBeacon.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xc59a78b07b44b2cf2e8ab4175fca91e8eca1eee2df7357b8d2a8833e5ea1f64c\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://5aa4f07e65444784c29cd7bfcc2341b34381e4e5b5da9f0c5bd00d7f430e66fa\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmWRMh4Q9DpaU9GvsiXmDdoNYMyyece9if7hnfLz7uqzWM\"]},\"contracts/lib/@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/utils/Initializable.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x631188737069917d2f909d29ce62c4d48611d326686ba6683e26b72a23bfac0b\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://7a61054ae84cd6c4d04c0c4450ba1d6de41e27e0a2c4f1bcdf58f796b401c609\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmUvtdp7X1mRVyC3CsHrtPbgoqWaXHp3S1ZR24tpAQYJWM\"]},\"contracts/lib/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Address.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xaf28a975a78550e45f65e559a3ad6a5ad43b9b8a37366999abd1b7084eb70721\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://b7bd24e224f67f65bfadf85dc2929fa965456bb2415478bd0125471b5ce35245\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmRaydGr8BTHs1kvaZfsNU69pKzUAGFrvABn1KiRSbE51y\"]}